Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Bănci și Servicii IT și consultanță IT
Your digital journey starts here! 
 Create. Grow. Deliver our story to millions. 
 #BTCode, where technology meets creativity. Code is our universal language and innovation is the fuel that propels us into the future. 🚀
 If you’ll join our team, you will be challenged to: 
Install, configure, maintain, and upgrade middleware platforms across multiple environments (Dev, Test, Production);
Ensure high availability, performance, and reliability of middleware solutions through proactive monitoring and tuning;
Perform capacity planning and participate in scalability design for supported platforms;
Maintain systems up to date with security patches and vendor-recommended updates;
Collaborate with development and architecture teams to design and implement middleware solutions aligned with business requirements;
Contribute to automation initiatives (deployments, configuration, monitoring);
Define and improve operational procedures, standards, and documentation;
Participate in incident management, problem management, and change management processes;
Contribute to cross-team and cross-department projects, supporting the bank’s strategic and operational objectives;
 Troubleshoot incidents end-to-end, including:
root cause analysis
solution design
implementation and validation
 To perform in this role, we would like you to have: 
Hands-on experience (minimum 2 years) with Apache Kafka / Confluent Platform (Relevant certifications are considered a plus);
Knowledge of scripting: Bash, Python, PowerShell;
Experience with automation and CI/CD tools: Ansible, Jenkins, Git;
Solid knowledge of Linux operating system (Windows is a plus);
Basic understanding or exposure to container platforms (Kubernetes / OpenShift) and cloud environments;
Understanding of: distributed systems concepts, high availability and disaster recovery architectures\ Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to work effectively under pressure during incident situations;
Good communication and collaboration skills;
Ability to work both independently;
 Nice to have: 
Experience with: HSSO / Keycloak, IBM MQ, Apache Flink.
